WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:04.860
Have you ever wondered about the deepest&nbsp;
desire of SCP-890, the Rocket Surgeon?

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:11.520
Foundation staff used SCP-978, the Desire Camera,&nbsp;
to snap a picture of SCP-890 while it was seated&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:16.560
at its desk in its cell, reading a non-classified&nbsp;
medical journal. This was the result:

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:21.180
SCP-978 is visible on the&nbsp;
desk in front of SCP-890.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:24.600
SCP-890 is rolling its eyes and&nbsp;
pointing to the door to its cell.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:29.520
Note: When shown the photograph, SCP-890&nbsp;
stated that although it would never&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:34.920
actually "be that rude to a patient",&nbsp;
it has "no time for hypochondriacs".

